{
  "slug": "wokku",
  "name": "Wokku",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Deploy and manage apps on Wokku — the open-source Heroku alternative — directly from Claude Code using natural language",
  "longDescription": "Ships **4 skills** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (4): `add-database` (Create a database on Wokku and link it to an app — sets connection URL as env var…), `deploy-new-app` (Deploy a new app to Wokku from the current project — creates the app, sets config, and walks…), `setup-github-deploy` (Connect a GitHub repository to a Wokku app for automatic deployment on every push), `troubleshoot` (Systematic debugging for Wokku apps — check status, logs, health, deploys, and suggest fixes)\n- **MCP servers** (1): `wokku`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install wokku@claude-community` from `johannesdwicahyo/wokku-plugin` (`plugins/wokku`).",
  "compatibility": [
